s://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/04/Right-Side-Mobile-Devices5.mp4"}]]}]]}]}]}],false,false]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Intro_intro__kvY3Y","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"Intro_text__1JkoM","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Introduction</h2>\n<p>Green Square Infra operates in a competitive residential real estate market where reaching the right buyers and generating consistent property enquiries can make a real difference. Kyoto Creative partnered with Green Square Infra to strengthen its digital presence through a newly designed and developed website, supported by a targeted performance marketing strategy.</p>\n<p>Our goal was to create more than an online presence. We wanted to build a digital foundation that could connect prospective homebuyers with Green Square Infra's residential projects and turn online interest into actionable enquiries.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: bca9457c-0e6d-44d3-a047-ec1218303f79 --></p>\n"}}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Intro_projectDetails__UWcsm","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"Intro_left__d8bha","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"delay":0.15,"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"Intro_smallHeading__gYXTn","children":"Industry"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Film & TV Production"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"Intro_smallHeading__gYXTn","children":"Location"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Global"}]]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Intro_right__E3UWy","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"delay":0.15,"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"Intro_smallHeading__gYXTn","children":"Featured by"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Intro_list__65yay","children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://www.itsnicethat.com/articles/kota-universal-production-partners-website-sponsored-content-240925","target":"_blank","children":"It's Nice That"}],["$","a","1",{"href":"https://www.awwwards.com/sites/upp","target":"_blank","children":"Awwwards"}]]}]]}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Intro_link__Wrq2r","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"delay":0.3,"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.upp.cz/","target":"_blank","style":{"backgroundColor":"#000000","borderColor":"#000000"},"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":"Visit site"}],["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 12.6 12.6","className":"Intro_buttonArrow___9UE0","children":[["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M11.85 12.6c-.41 0-.75-.34-.75-.75V1.5H.75C.34 1.5 0 1.16 0 .75S.34 0 .75 0h11.1c.41 0 .75.34.75.75v11.1c0 .41-.34.75-.75.75z"}],["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M1.13 12.21c-.19 0-.38-.07-.53-.22a.754.754 0 010-1.06L11.32.22c.29-.29.77-.29 1.06 0 .29.29.29.77 0 1.06L1.66 11.99c-.15.15-.34.22-.53.22z"}]]}]]}]}]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"ContentBuilder_contentBuilder__FAKQG","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"$undefined","data-margin":"default","children":[false,["$","div",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":["$","$L20",null,{"data":{"__typename":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","fieldGroupName":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","alignment":"fullPageWidth","marginBottom":"default","loop":{"mediaItemUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/04/All-Pages-3D-2.mp4"},"fullVideo":null}}]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy","data-margin":"default","data-right-empty":"true","style":{"--brand-color":"red"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h3>The Challenge</h3>\n<p>We wanted UPP’s site to reflect the cinematic depth, artistry, and innovation that define their work. It had to be an <span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"1\">immersive, seamless, and boundary-pushing website</span>—one that transports visitors into their world from the moment they land.</p>\n<p>Far from a traditional website, it feels like stepping into an immersive corridor. As you navigate, you walk through a digital space filled with beautiful reflections, expansive skies, and cinematic lighting effects that echo the artistry of UPP’s work.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 31db7c5b-1164-4e5a-9aba-e2bb4d637880 --></p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"$undefined","data-margin":"default","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"SingleImage_containedImage__N2jLD","children":["$","$L20",null,{"data":{"__typename":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","fieldGroupName":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","alignment":"contained","marginBottom":"default","loop":{"mediaItemUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/04/Zoom-In-New.mp4"},"fullVideo":null}}]}]}],false]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy","data-margin":"default","data-right-empty":"true","style":{"--brand-color":"red"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h3>The Strategy</h3>\n<p><strong>Pushing the limits of web design</strong></p>\n<p>To achieve this, we designed a site that fuses motion, interactivity, and storytelling into a seamless experience.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>We implemented fluid transitions, 3D effects, and motion-driven interactions that mimic the feeling of stepping into a movie universe.</li>\n<li>Dynamic scrolling effects guide users through UPP’s portfolio, bringing their VFX work to life as they navigate.</li>\n<li>The homepage unfolds seamlessly, instantly immersing visitors in UPP’s world of visual effects mastery.<br />\n<!-- notionvc: ac4e158f-d8aa-4f18-8a0c-1a828e6de751 --></li>\n</ul>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 57c0407b-f9ed-458e-b86e-f4f57a21d9e0 --></p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Results_results__xMS5p","data-margin":"default","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"Results_heading__f0DwF","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"children":"Results 30 days post-launch"}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Results_resultsContent__fDMiF","children":["$","$L1e",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Results_resultsContentInner__gRwSH","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"Results_result__7T6EL","style":{"backgroundColor":"#000000","color":"#fff"},"data-animation":"grid-item","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"Results_figure__t8hvp","children":"+44.8%"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"Results_description__KhIC1","children":" increase in sessions from Google."}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"Results_result__7T6EL","style":{"backgroundColor":"#000000","color":"#fff"},"data-animation":"grid-item","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"Results_figure__t8hvp","children":"+101.4%"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"Results_description__KhIC1","children":"increase in users from referrals."}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"Results_result__7T6EL","style":{"backgroundColor":"#000000","color":"#fff"},"data-animation":"grid-item","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"Results_figure__t8hvp","children":"+150.6%"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"Results_description__KhIC1","children":"increase in user stickiness."}]]}]]}]}]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy","data-margin":"default","data-right-empty":"true","style":{"--brand-color":"red"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h3>The future of web as an experience</h3>\n<p>This project redefines what a website can be. UPP’s site is not just a portfolio—it’s a statement. As the web continues to evolve into a more interactive, experiential space, brands have the opportunity to captivate users in ways that go beyond traditional web design.</p>\n<p>For UPP, it was about creating a digital experience worthy of the cinematic masterpieces they help bring to life.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: d14cb454-488e-4264-a40d-56c17c124610 --></p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Quote_quote__8BTRS","data-margin":"default","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Quote_quoteContent__SngAv","children":[["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 38.48 36.59","children":["$","path",null,{"fill":"#000000","d":"M0 0l1.71 36.59h10.26L13.68 0H0zm24.8 0l1.71 36.59h10.26L38.48 0H24.8z"}]}]}],["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"className":"Quote_quoteText__isGTS","children":"From the very first conversations, James, KOTA’s Creative Director, understood our vision. He didn’t just meet the brief—he transformed it. The concept he delivered was beyond what we had imagined: a bold, elegant experience that positions UPP at the leading edge of both design and digital storytelling. It’s no exaggeration to say the final product redefines what a website can be. We’ve even adopted a new line in talking about it: “It’s not a website, it’s an experience.\""}]}],["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Quote_attribution__LU91Y","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"Quote_attributionName__ABzkp","children":"Gunajit Dutta"}],["$","p",null,{"c